1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,970
Meet AEGIS: compliance audits for network devices, from any vendor. The AI suggests.

2
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,829
Humans decide. Rules judge.

3
00:00:10,429 --> 00:00:13,157
Let's upload a Cisco router's configuration.

4
00:00:13,507 --> 00:00:16,672
Before any AI sees it, secrets are removed,

5
00:00:16,722 --> 00:00:19,789
and any text aimed at the AI is quarantined.

6
00:00:20,139 --> 00:00:23,161
Six secrets were hidden. They are never stored.

7
00:00:23,511 --> 00:00:28,860
Now, the verdict. It comes only from cited rules, never from the AI.

8
00:00:29,709 --> 00:00:32,815
Every finding shows its evidence, and how it was decided.

9
00:00:33,165 --> 00:00:38,443
A setting the config never mentions is reported as unknown. Never a silent pass.

10
00:00:38,793 --> 00:00:41,691
Lines AEGIS can't read go to a human reviewer.

11
00:00:43,585 --> 00:00:48,040
The reviewer maps this policy tag to logging enabled, and adds a note.

12
00:00:51,846 --> 00:00:53,125
One confirmation,

13
00:00:54,566 --> 00:00:57,540
and it becomes a permanent, hash-chained decision.

14
00:00:57,890 --> 00:01:03,444
Next, a misconfigured router. It carries the same line, and a hidden attack.

15
00:01:03,794 --> 00:01:06,641
The injection is blocked before any AI call.

16
00:01:12,562 --> 00:01:15,221
The taught line is now recognized instantly.

17
00:01:15,671 --> 00:01:19,543
And this access list allows everything before it denies telnet.

18
00:01:19,693 --> 00:01:23,187
AEGIS catches the dead rule, and shows the exact fix.

19
00:01:23,537 --> 00:01:25,104
Every report is signed.

20
00:01:29,242 --> 00:01:32,001
One click verifies that nothing was changed.

21
00:01:32,351 --> 00:01:35,061
Insights show how every finding was decided,

22
00:01:36,879 --> 00:01:40,146
and how much of each official STIG benchmark is automated.

23
00:01:40,846 --> 00:01:43,198
We locked our answer key before the test.

24
00:01:43,398 --> 00:01:48,317
On real configs it had never seen, AEGIS gave zero false passes.

